(text "cubbies V1 - XIAO ESP32-C3 series build. Modules are wired by hand (assembly.md); U1 odd pins = XIAO left row D0..D6, even pins = right row 5V..D7.\nC3 Super Mini prototypes: buzzer GPIO0, SDA GPIO8, SCK GPIO4, MOSI GPIO6, CS GPIO7, DC GPIO5, BCLK GPIO2 (+47k), WS GPIO3, SD GPIO10, TOUCH GPIO1, SCL GPIO21.\nValues in the benches are read from this sheet: hardware/electronics/sim/schematic.lib (run.sh)." (exclude_from_sim yes) (at 38.1 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 9e952ca1-223b-4b96-8090-4ebad74d4f08))
(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))) (embedded_fonts no))
